    "findings": [
      "Inspected all 36 after captures in four labelled contact sheets and enlarged representative desktop/mobile images; all four before captures inspected directly.",
      "Responsive cards stack at 390px and form three columns at 1440px, without horizontal overflow. Navigation, theme button, weekly history, definitions and footer remain readable in both themes.",
      "Observed-zero report uses a real read-only aggregate query against the pinned database. Stale, unavailable and suppressed states use explicitly isolated browser fixtures, never deployed data.",
      "Stale and unavailable notices are visible in amber. Unavailable removes numeric cards; privacy suppression displays Private rather than zero. Every displayed numeric cell includes its source timestamp."
    ],
    "fixesApplied": [
      "Resolve shared palette colors at render time so light theme does not retain dark card or link colors.",
      "Disable smooth scrolling in capture navigation so intended sections are actually visible."
    ],
